### Geocoding Service API Examples
### Base URL: http://dev-fwd.cec.delllabs.net:8000
###
### Endpoints
###   GET  /features          – which optional features are enabled
###   GET  /geocode           – full-text + vector + geo search
###   GET  /address           – structured address search
###   GET  /reverse           – reverse geocoding (lat/lon → nearest address / street / boundaries)
###   POST /feedback          – popularity feedback loop
###   POST /places            – add a custom place
###   POST /insert            – insert raw OSM element via NATS
###
### Debugging helpers at the bottom:
###   Elasticsearch direct queries
###   PostGIS direct queries (REST is not available, see SQL section comments)

@baseUrl = http://dev-fwd.cec.delllabs.net:8000

# ============================================================================
# Feature Flags
# ============================================================================

### Check which features are enabled (vectors, AI)
GET {{baseUrl}}/features

###

# ============================================================================
# /geocode  –  Full-text + vector + geo-decay search (Elasticsearch)
#
# Params:
#   q      (required) – free-text query
#   lat/lon            – bias results toward this location
#   limit              – max results (1–50, default 10)
#   vector=true|false  – enable/disable semantic vector re-ranking
#   ai=true|false      – enable/disable AI-assisted expansion
# ============================================================================

### Basic city search
GET {{baseUrl}}/geocode?q=9 pentland cres
### Basic city search
GET {{baseUrl}}/geocode?q=farm boy
###

### Search with geo-distance bias (near the Pyramids)
GET {{baseUrl}}/geocode?q=pyramids&lat=29.9792&lon=31.1342&limit=5

###

### Tahrir Square with Cairo location bias
GET {{baseUrl}}/geocode?q=tahrir square&lat=30.0444&lon=31.2357&limit=10

###

### Text-only search, no vector re-ranking (faster)
GET {{baseUrl}}/geocode?q=alexandria&limit=10&vector=false

###

### Fuzzy / typo-tolerant search
GET {{baseUrl}}/geocode?q=kahira&lat=30.0444&lon=31.2357&limit=5

###

### Search for a venue type near Cairo
GET {{baseUrl}}/geocode?q=restaurant&lat=30.0444&lon=31.2357&limit=15

###

### Address-like query auto-detected and blended into /geocode
### (housenumber + street clauses added automatically)
GET {{baseUrl}}/geocode?q=10 Tahrir Street, Cairo&lat=30.0444&lon=31.2357&limit=5

###

### Arabic name search
GET {{baseUrl}}/geocode?q=القاهرة&limit=10

###

# ============================================================================
# /address  –  Structured address search (Elasticsearch)
#
# Params:
#   q        (required) – free-form or structured address string
#   lat/lon              – proximity boost (500 m scale, weight=4)
#   limit                – max results (1–50, default 10)
#   postcode             – hard filter: restrict to this postal code
#   city                 – hard filter: restrict to this city
#   country              – hard filter: restrict to ISO country code (e.g. EG)
#
# Only elements with at least one addr:* tag are returned.
# The response includes a `parsed` field showing how the query was interpreted.
# ============================================================================

### Full address: housenumber + street + city (auto-parsed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/address?q=10 Tahrir Street, Cairo

###

### Street and city, no house number
GET {{baseUrl}}/address?q=Tahrir Street, Cairo&limit=10

###

### Street only with explicit city filter param
GET {{baseUrl}}/address?q=Corniche El Nil&city=Cairo&limit=10

###

### Street with country restriction
GET {{baseUrl}}/address?q=Nile Street&country=EG&limit=10

###

### Postcode lookup – find all addresses in a postal district
GET {{baseUrl}}/address?q=11511

###

### Postcode as hard filter combined with street query
GET {{baseUrl}}/address?q=Tahrir Street&postcode=11511

###

### With proximity bias (near Tahrir Square)
GET {{baseUrl}}/address?q=Tahrir Street&lat=30.0444&lon=31.2357&limit=10

###

### Building number + street + city with proximity and country filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/address?q=15 Kasr El Aini Street, Cairo&lat=30.0380&lon=31.2336&country=EG&limit=5

###

### Arabic address – street in Arabic script
GET {{baseUrl}}/address?q=شارع التحرير, القاهرة

###

### Arabic full address with housenumber
GET {{baseUrl}}/address?q=10 شارع التحرير, القاهرة&lat=30.0444&lon=31.2357

###

### Suburb / neighbourhood search via address endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/address?q=Zamalek, Cairo&lat=30.0614&lon=31.2208&limit=10

###

### Alexandria address with proximity
GET {{baseUrl}}/address?q=Corniche Road, Alexandria&lat=31.2088&lon=29.9183&limit=10

###

### Minimal – single street name, result capped to 5
GET {{baseUrl}}/address?q=El Galaa Street&limit=5

###

# ============================================================================
# /reverse  –  Reverse geocoding (PostGIS + Elasticsearch)
#
# Params:
#   lat  (required) – latitude
#   lon  (required) – longitude
#
# Returns:
#   nearest_address    – closest building/address point from osm_addresses table
#                        fields: housenumber, street, city, postcode, country,
#                                full_address, geom, distance_m
#   nearest_line       – closest LineString (road/path) with ES metadata
#                        fields: osm_id, osm_type, name, name_en, tags,
#                                admin_level, area_km2, offline_rank, geom
#   enclosing_polygons – all polygons/multipolygons containing the point
#                        (admin boundaries, landuse areas, etc.) sorted by
#                        admin_level descending (most specific first)
#                        same fields as nearest_line
# ============================================================================

### Reverse geocode Tahrir Square, Cairo
GET {{baseUrl}}/reverse?lat=30.0444&lon=31.2357

###

### Reverse geocode near the Giza Pyramids
GET {{baseUrl}}/reverse?lat=29.9792&lon=31.1342

###

### Reverse geocode in downtown Alexandria
GET {{baseUrl}}/reverse?lat=31.2088&lon=29.9183

###

### Reverse geocode in Zamalek (Cairo island district)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reverse?lat=30.0614&lon=31.2208

###

### Reverse geocode near the Nile in Cairo
GET {{baseUrl}}/reverse?lat=30.0500&lon=31.2336

###

### Reverse geocode in Heliopolis (northeast Cairo)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reverse?lat=30.0928&lon=31.3201

###

### Reverse geocode in Aswan (southern Egypt)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reverse?lat=24.0889&lon=32.8998

###

# ============================================================================
# /feedback  –  Popularity feedback loop
# Increments the popularity field in Elasticsearch for a given osm_id.
# Higher popularity → higher ranking in future /geocode results.
# ============================================================================

### Default boost (+1.0)
POST {{baseUrl}}/feedback?osm_id=n271613766&boost=1.0

###

### Stronger boost for a highly-clicked result
POST {{baseUrl}}/feedback?osm_id=n271613766&boost=5.0

###

# ============================================================================
# /places  –  Add a custom place
# Publishes to NATS stream; picked up by es-inserter and postgis-inserter.
# New address fields: addr_housenumber, addr_street, addr_city,
#                     addr_postcode, addr_country, addr_suburb, addr_state
# ============================================================================

### Minimal – name + coordinates
POST {{baseUrl}}/places
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Downtown Cafe",
  "lat": 30.0500,
  "lon": 31.2400,
  "tags": { "amenity": "cafe" }
}

###

### Restaurant with address fields
POST {{baseUrl}}/places
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nile View Restaurant",
  "name_en": "Nile View Restaurant",
  "lat": 30.0444,
  "lon": 31.2357,
  "osm_type": "node",
  "admin_level": 8,
  "tags": {
    "amenity": "restaurant",
    "cuisine": "egyptian"
  },
  "addr_housenumber": "5",
  "addr_street": "Corniche El Nil",
  "addr_city": "Cairo",
  "addr_postcode": "11511",
  "addr_country": "EG"
}

###

### Building with full address (will appear in /address and /reverse results)
POST {{baseUrl}}/places
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Office Tower",
  "lat": 30.0380,
  "lon": 31.2336,
  "osm_type": "node",
  "tags": { "building": "commercial" },
  "addr_housenumber": "22",
  "addr_street": "Kasr El Aini Street",
  "addr_suburb": "Garden City",
  "addr_city": "Cairo",
  "addr_postcode": "11516",
  "addr_country": "EG"
}

###

### Museum with English name and tags
POST {{baseUrl}}/places
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "متحف مصر",
  "name_en": "Egyptian Museum",
  "lat": 30.0479,
  "lon": 31.2355,
  "osm_type": "node",
  "admin_level": 8,
  "tags": {
    "tourism": "museum",
    "historic": "yes"
  },
  "addr_street": "El Tahrir Square",
  "addr_city": "Cairo",
  "addr_country": "EG"
}

###

# ============================================================================
# /insert  –  Raw OSM element insertion (matches watcher.py message format)
# Useful for injecting test data or replaying elements.
# ============================================================================

### Node with address tags (will be indexed as an address point)
POST {{baseUrl}}/insert
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "osm_id": "n999001",
  "osm_type": "node",
  "tags": {
    "name": "Sample Building",
    "building": "yes",
    "addr:housenumber": "42",
    "addr:street": "Tahrir Street",
    "addr:city": "Cairo",
    "addr:postcode": "11511",
    "addr:country": "EG"
  },
  "geom": {
    "type": "Point",
    "coordinates": [31.2357, 30.0444]
  },
  "admin_level": 0,
  "area_km2": 0.0
}

###

### Way (road/LineString) – becomes nearest_line candidate in /reverse
POST {{baseUrl}}/insert
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "osm_id": "w888001",
  "osm_type": "way",
  "tags": {
    "name": "Tahrir Street",
    "name:en": "Tahrir Street",
    "highway": "primary",
    "addr:street": "Tahrir Street"
  },
  "geom": {
    "type": "LineString",
    "coordinates": [
      [31.2340, 30.0440],
      [31.2355, 30.0444],
      [31.2370, 30.0448]
    ]
  },
  "admin_level": 0,
  "area_km2": 0.0
}

###

### Administrative boundary polygon – becomes enclosing_polygon in /reverse
POST {{baseUrl}}/insert
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "osm_id": "r777001",
  "osm_type": "relation",
  "tags": {
    "name": "Cairo Governorate",
    "name:en": "Cairo Governorate",
    "boundary": "administrative",
    "admin_level": "4"
  },
  "geom": {
    "type": "Polygon",
    "coordinates": [[
      [31.1, 29.9],
      [31.5, 29.9],
      [31.5, 30.2],
      [31.1, 30.2],
      [31.1, 29.9]
    ]]
  },
  "admin_level": 4,
  "area_km2": 3085.0
}

###

# ============================================================================
# Elasticsearch Debug  –  direct index access
# ============================================================================

### Document count
GET http://dev-fwd.cec.delllabs.net:9200/osm_places/_count

###

### Index mapping (shows all fields including addr_*)
GET http://dev-fwd.cec.delllabs.net:9200/osm_places/_mapping

###

### Count documents that have address data
POST http://dev-fwd.cec.delllabs.net:9200/osm_places/_count
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": { "term": { "has_address": true } }
}

###

### Sample 5 address-bearing documents
POST http://dev-fwd.cec.delllabs.net:9200/osm_places/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": { "term": { "has_address": true } },
  "size": 5,
  "_source": ["osm_id", "name", "full_address", "addr_street", "addr_city", "addr_postcode", "centroid"]
}

###

### Direct address field search on Elasticsearch
POST http://dev-fwd.cec.delllabs.net:9200/osm_places/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": {
    "bool": {
      "must": [
        { "term":  { "addr_housenumber": "10" } },
        { "match": { "addr_street": "Tahrir Street" } }
      ],
      "filter": [
        { "term": { "has_address": true } }
      ]
    }
  },
  "size": 5,
  "_source": ["osm_id", "name", "full_address", "addr_housenumber", "addr_street", "addr_city", "centroid"]
}

###

### Full-text address search
POST http://dev-fwd.cec.delllabs.net:9200/osm_places/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": {
    "match": { "full_address": "Tahrir Street Cairo" }
  },
  "size": 10,
  "_source": ["osm_id", "name", "full_address", "centroid"]
}

###

### Geocode directly (raw function_score query)
POST http://dev-fwd.cec.delllabs.net:9200/osm_places/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": {
    "match": { "name": "cairo" }
  },
  "size": 5
}

###
GET http://dev-fwd.cec.delllabs.net:9200/osm_places/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "size": 50,
  "query": {
    "match_phrase": {
      "addr_street": "Pentland Crescent"
    }
  },
  "_source": [
    "addr_housenumber",
    "addr_street",
    "addr_city",
    "osm_id"
  ],
  "sort": [
    {
      "addr_housenumber": {
        "order": "asc"
      }
    }
  ]
}
